  - m_Id: 6531873135693824
    m_Key: '"The Last Hero II: 1793" is set to release soon! (Perhaps the previous
      work should be renamed "The Second-to-Last Hero"?)


      Our development
      team has undergone a major overhaul. In this new title, guided by principles
      of openness and inclusivity, we have incorporated substantial elements exploring
      diverse gender identities, feminism, people of color, and more. Our aim is
      to encourage players to embrace marginalized groups and dismantle prejudices
      against them.'
